{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6c12701d", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Secondary vertex (SV)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph does not record any analyses that explicitly define a region requiring a secondary vertex (SV). However, the following papers mention regions that include secondary vertices in their labels:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Semileptonic ttbar validation sample for c jet M_SV template (muon+>=4 jets)\n- **2001.06899**: High-purity ttbar control region for b jet M_SV template (lepton+>=2 jets, >=1 b-tagged jet)\n- **2001.06899**: W+jets validation sample for light-jet M_SV template (muon+>=1 jet)\n- **2004.01678**: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2009.14537**: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- **2012.01581**: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2)\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2102.01444**: VR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,DF}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ validation region, different-flavour leptons\n- **2102.01444**: VR$^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,SF}$: two-body $t\\bar t$ validation region, same-flavour leptons\n- **2102.01444**: VR$^{3-body}_{VV}$: three-body diboson validation region\n- **2102.01444**: VR$^{4-body}_{VV}$: four-body diboson validation region (two-lepton)\n- **2102.01444**: VR$^{4-body}_{VV,3\\ell}$: four-body diboson validation region (three-lepton)\n- **2107.12553**: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2112.00895**: SV channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed)\n- **2112.00895**: SV channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)\n- **2302.05225**: Signal region, non-VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (Symmetry method)\n- **2302.05225**: Signal region, VBF category, ltau_lprime channel (Symmetry method)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2304.08962**: Non-prompt region: reversed vertex-quality requirements\n- **2308.02285**: SV (secondary vertex) charm-tag selection region\n- **2503.19420**: Same-sign 2-muon signal region\n- **2503.19420**: Same-sign 2-electron signal region\n- **2508.13900**: Common preselection region (all channels)\n\nThese papers mention regions that involve", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2009.14537", "2012.01581", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.00895", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Secondary vertex (SV)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 42, "error": null, "seconds": 0.108}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.022}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:sv-charm-tag", "hepkg:region:sv_electron", "hepkg:region:sv_muon", "hepkg:region:nonprompt_region", "hepkg:region:superbin-sv", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:signal_region", "hepkg:region:sr_vbf_ltau_lprime_symmetry", "hepkg:region:merged2-ggHH-SR2", "hepkg:region:sr_nonvbf_ltau_lprime_symmetry", "hepkg:region:merged2-ggHH-SR3", "hepkg:region:vr-4body-vv", "hepkg:region:ss2mu-sr", "hepkg:region:merged2-qqHH-SR", "hepkg:region:vr-3body-vv", "hepkg:region:ss2e-sr", "hepkg:region:wjets_light_template_cr", "hepkg:region:ttbar_semileptonic_c_template_cr", "hepkg:region:vhh_bbbb_resolved", "hepkg:region:ttbar_bjet_template_cr", "hepkg:region:vr-2body-ttbar-df", "hepkg:region:vh_had_sm_tag2", "hepkg:region:superbin-2l-ossf", "