{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6d241652", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Ghost-associated track?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define the object 'Ghost-associated track':\\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2007.02873: Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→bb decay channel in pp collisions at 13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- 2109.13808: Constraints on Higgs boson properties using WW*(→eνμν)jj production in 36.1 fb−1 of √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential WZ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→bb decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2202.08676: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at √s=13 TeV in the H→γγ channel using 139 fb−1 of pp collision data with the ATLAS experiment\\n- 2207.12246: Measurement of the total cross section and ρ-parameter from elastic scattering in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→tt̄ production at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of ttZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of ttW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for W and Z boson production in proton-proton collisions at √s=5.02 and 13 TeV\\n- 2503.19420: 3-lepton final state (WH, all bosons leptonic)\\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at √s", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Ghost-associated track", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 26, "error": null, "seconds": 0.118}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 74, "error": null,