{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-97ed8950", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background 'Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)':\n\n- 2110.11231: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2405.18661: CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\n- 2510.07527: HH->multilepton analysis result\n- 2602.18611: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2604.27044: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Other Higgs background (VH production and H->tautau decays)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.195}, {"round": 2, "tool": "refine", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "drop_ids": ["hepkg:background:singleh", "hepkg:background:ggf_contamination", "hepkg:background:ggf_production", "hepkg:background:vbf_production", "hepkg:background:other-sm-minor", "hepkg:background:zz-ww-vvv", "hepkg:background:bbgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:other", "hepkg:background:other-sm-bkg", "hepkg:background:z_jets", "hepkg:background:rare", "hepkg:background:single_higgs_bkg_dihiggs", "hepkg:background:flavor_symmetric", "hepkg:background:wwgamgam_singleH", "hepkg:background:zz_h_prompt", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background: