{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-bba8fab9", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background DY+jets background estimate in the SR?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the DY+jets background in the signal region (SR):\n\n- **2004.14060**: *Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2007.02873**: *Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2010.14293**: *Search for squarks and gluinos in final states with jets and missing transverse momentum using 139 fb\\(^{-1}\\) of \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV \\( pp \\) collision data with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2012.03799**: *Search for new phenomena with top quark pairs in final states with one lepton, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2102.01444**: *Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2106.01676**: *Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2111.08340**: *Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector*\n- **2208.12095**: *Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector*\n- **2308.02285**: *Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)*\n- **2312.04450**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\n- **2408.03744**: *Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) and 13 TeV*\n- **2503.19420**: *Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV*\n- **2506.13565**: *Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with \\( b \\)-tagged jets in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "DY+jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.109}, {"round": 1, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 33, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 2, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepk