{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-e659786a", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate the background Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background from Z+jets and ttbar:\\n\\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n\\nAdditionally, the following analyses use Z+jets and ttbar samples:\\n\\n- **2006.05880**: Search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or $Z$ boson using 139 fb -1 of $pp$ collision data at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets and missing transverse momentum in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\\\,\\\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2109.13808**: ggF + 2 jets CP-sensitive analysis of the effective Higgs-gluon coupling\\n- **2109.13808**: VBF HVV polarisation-coupling analysis (a_L, a_T / kappa_VV, epsilon_VV)\\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2307.01094**: Search for pair production of squarks or gluinos decaying via sleptons or weak bosons in final states with two same-sign or three leptons with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $\\\\mathup{{{W}}}$ and $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\\n- **2506.13565**: Search for nonresonant new physics signals in high-mass dilepton events produced in association with $\\\\math", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Nonprompt lepton (reducible) background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.155}, {"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Z+jets", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.131}, {"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar", "kind": "sample"}, "rows": 34, "error": null, "seconds": 0.163}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_ids": ["hepkg:background:nonprompt_lepton"]}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.026}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_uses_sample", "object_ids": ["hepkg:sample:z_plus_jets", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.031}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:8082f0673970bd836137f703"]}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:33a6f7b6bd891f45d2688022", "hepkg:result:989da7e0af809d38ad040be8", "hepkg:result:46ee77edd095181b02474a60", "hepkg:result:d5288b5bc0407b0b2005d131", "hepkg:result:vbf_hvv_polarization_analysis", "hepkg:result:ggf2jets_cp_analysis"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.006}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbww_misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:continuum-vh", "hepkg:background:continuum_diphoton", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:dpe_background", "hepkg:background:drell-yan-tautau", "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:fake-nonprompt-leptons", "hepkg:background:flavor_symmetric", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:gamma-jets", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu", "hepkg:background:jets-nonprompt", "hepkg:background:mis-id-leptons", "hepkg:background:mis