{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-e7b4530f", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Predicted background level uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Predicted background level uncertainty':\n\n- 2001.06899: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using H→b̄b decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2202.08676: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at √s=13 TeV\n- 2207.00348: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at √s=13 TeV in the H→γγ channel using 139 fb⁻¹ of pp collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- 2207.12246: Measurement of the total cross section and ρ-parameter from elastic scattering in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2303.15340: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton t̄t production measured in √s=13 TeV pp collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- 2308.02285: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t̄tb̄b production in the lepton+jets channel at √s=13 TeV\n- 2312.04450: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- 2401.05299: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of t̄tW production in pp collisions at √s=13 TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from pp collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2408.03744: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for W and Z boson production in proton-proton collisions at √s=5.02 and 13 TeV\n- 2602.18611: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV\n- 2604.27044: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4b final state\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at √s=13 TeV", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Predicted background level uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.155}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 77, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "he