{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-66894990", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\":\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2207.00348**: Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese papers cover the specified region.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.241}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 65, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:99f6575cff4954b41554a576", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:f8f2454a11f62d465dc04702", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5"]}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:3lF_sr", "hepkg:region:4lHIJK_sr", "hepkg:region:SRS", "hepkg:region:SR_b", "hepkg:region:SR_b_j_b", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hcc", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:fundamental-ltmet-table", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-ge10", "hepkg:region:ggH-0j-pt-lt10", "hepkg:region:gg