{"run_id": "20260816T025138-hepkg-48552", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6bb72043", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "1e89c73f9f7f", "git_sha": "7b7a794-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured f_Lambda1 (HVV effective fractional cross section)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The search for \"f_Lambda1 (HVV effective fractional cross section)\" did not find any exact matches in the observables. However, I found several observables that are related to coupling constraints, polarisation fractions, and signal strengths. These observables are measured in various analyses, but none of them specifically measure the HVV effective fractional cross section.\n\nTo provide a complete answer, let me list the analyses that measure observables similar to the one you are interested in:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections**:\n   - Observable: Total Higgs boson production cross section\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450`\n\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production**:\n   - Observable: VBF HH production signal strength\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437`\n\n3. **Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result**:\n   - Observable: Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling modifier (kappa_lambda)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3`\n\n4. **Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result**:\n   - Observable: Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling modifier (kappa_lambda)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:combined-run3`\n\n5. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum**:\n   - Observable: Higgs boson signal strength within fiducial volume (p_T^H > 450 GeV, |y_H| < 2)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`\n\n6. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**:\n   - Observable: Branching fraction B(H→μμ)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad`\n\n7. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in pp→t̄t production**:\n   - Observable: Top-quark pair charge asymmetry A_C^(t̄t)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19`\n\n8. **Fiducial t̄tW cross-section measurement**:\n   - Observable: Fiducial t̄tW production cross-section\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:ttw-fiducial-xsec`\n\n9. **Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement**:\n   - Observable: Fiducial WZ production cross section (particle-level fiducial region)\n   - Result: `hepkg:result:wz-fiducial-xsec`\n\n10. **Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling constraint via NLO EW corrections**:\n    - Observable: Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling modifier (kappa_lambda)\n    - Result: `hepkg:result:higgs_selfcoupling_fit`\n\n11. **Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t̄tb production**:\n    - Observable: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of t̄tb production in the lepton+jets channel\n    - Result: `hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2`\n\n12. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of t̄tZ production**:\n    - Observable:", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_Lambda1", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "seconds": 0.098}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:branching-fraction-h-mumu", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_leptonquark", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_z", "hepkg:observable:fid